      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY


    Welcome to Coin Run!


    Your goal is to collect 15 coins before the timer reaches zero.


    You have 30 seconds to complete the level.


    Move the ball around the course and collect the yellow coins.


    Be careful around the edges and obstacles. If the ball falls off the platform, you lose the game.


    Collect all 15 coins before time runs out to win.


    You can choose your player name and ball colour in the Main Menu.


    Open Settings to change the music volume, turn the music on or off, and change fullscreen mode.


    Good luck and collect all the coins!'
